<title>USA: Inver Grove, Minn., won by Dougherty Dawkins. [CORRECTED 01:16 GMT 2/10]</title>
<headline>Inver Grove, Minn., won by Dougherty Dawkins. [CORRECTED 01:16 GMT 2/10]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dougherty Dawkins, Strad &amp; Bigelow, Inc. said it won $1.3 million Inver Grove Heights, Minn., (corrects from Minnesota State Armory Building Commission) armory bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.877 percent.</p>
</text>
